==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From the {{etyl|enm}} ''[[ransoun]],'' from the {{etyl|fro}} ''[[rançon]],'' from the {{etyl|la}} ''[[redemption]]-, [[redemptio-]]'' (see [[redemption]]). Entered English ca. the 13th century

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# [[money|Money]] paid for the [[free]]ing of a [[hostage]].

====Related terms====
* [[bail]]

